<title>FINLAND: Markka bonds gain in calm trade, markka steady.</title>
<headline>Markka bonds gain in calm trade, markka steady.</headline>
<text>
<p>1250/0950 GMT -- Bonds trade a shade firmer tracking trends overseas in quiet summer trade subdued partly by U.S. Independence Day holiday. Gap over Bunds steady. Market seen calm and incentiveless in near term, dealers say. Markka steady and seen unchanged.</p>
<p>---------------------1230 vs 1605 Thursday -------------------</p>
<p> *FIM-06 yld pct 5.91 vs 5.93   *06 gap over Bund bps 31 vs 31</p>
<p> *FIM-04 yld pct 5.50 vs 5.52   *FIM-99 yld pct 3.73 vs 3.74</p>
<p> *Sept FRAs 3.26 pct vs 3.26    *June FRAs 4.06 pct vs 4.06</p>
<p> *DEM/FIM 2.9750 vs 2.9795	*USD/FIM 5.2075 vs 5.2235</p>
<p> *SEK/FIM 0.6756 vs 0.6715	*ECU index 100.45 vs 100.47</p>
